<title>USA: West Harris Cty MUD 2 Texas won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>West Harris Cty MUD 2 Texas won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $2.160 million of West Harris Cty MUD 2, Texas, waterworks and sewer system combination tax and revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.76 percent.</p>
